{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1729532287_7514199_3b55a05724f4d84d5ed616a7cc972f6e.png",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; background-position: 0px 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal;\">Welcome to Shimmervee, your ultimate destination for women's fashion online. Founded in 2023, our mission is to empower women across the globe to express their unique style and individuality through our curated selection of contemporary and trendy clothing.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; background-position: 0px 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal;\">Our story began with a simple but transformative vision: to make high-quality, stylish clothing accessible for all women. Since then, we've been committed to providing a seamless online shopping experience that prioritizes not only the latest fashion trends but also the comfort and satisfaction of our customers.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; background-position: 0px 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal;\">At Shimmervee, we believe that fashion is more than just clothes; it's an expression of self-identity. Therefore, we are dedicated to offering a wide range of sizes, styles, and designs to ensure that every woman finds items that truly resonate with her personal style. From casual wear to formal outfits, activewear to loungewear, we provide a diverse array of options to suit any occasion.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; background-position: 0px 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal;\">We pride ourselves on our commitment to ethical sourcing and sustainable practices. Our clothes are crafted with integrity and care, reflecting our strong values of respect for people, animals, and the environment. We collaborate only with manufacturers who share our commitment to labor rights and environmental sustainability.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; background-position: 0px 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal;\">Shopping with Shimmervee is not just about buying clothes&mdash;it's about joining a community of women who celebrate their individuality and support each other. We are glad you're here and we can't wait to help you find your next favorite outfit.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; background-position: 0px 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal;\">Come, explore and shine with Shimmervee!</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>",
